@startuml Diagrama_09_GUI_Actualizar_Clima_Async
title SECUENCIA 9: GUI - ACTUALIZAR CLIMA (Asíncrono)
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE

actor Usuario
participant "VentanaPrincipal" as GUI
participant "JLabel\nlabelClima" as Label
participant "SwingWorker\n<<Async>>" as Worker
participant "ServicioClima" as Clima

Usuario -> GUI: Click botón\n"Actualizar Clima"

activate GUI

GUI -> Label: setText("☁️ Consultando API del clima...")
activate Label
Label --> GUI: void
deactivate Label

GUI -> Worker: new SwingWorker<ClimaInfo, Void>()
activate Worker

== Thread Separado (Background) ==

Worker -> Worker: doInBackground()
note right: NO bloquea Event Dispatch Thread

Worker -> Clima: obtenerClimaInfo()
activate Clima

Clima -> Clima: Verificar caché o consultar API
note right: Puede tardar varios segundos

Clima --> Worker: ClimaInfo resultado
deactivate Clima

== Thread de UI (Event Dispatch Thread) ==

Worker -> Worker: done()
Worker -> Worker: ClimaInfo resultado = get()

Worker -> Label: setText(resultado.toSimpleString())
activate Label

note right
☁️ Partly cloudy - 21°C | 23% | En vivo (14:30:00)
end note

Label --> Worker: void
deactivate Label

Worker --> GUI: void
deactivate Worker

GUI --> Usuario: Actualiza label con clima
deactivate GUI

@enduml
